  "ruleId": "REBATE-RESIDENT-INDIVIDUAL",
  "_note": "S2 s.156(1): \"An assesse, being an individual resident in India, shall be entitled to a deduction of 100% of income-tax payable or ₹ 12500, whichever is less … if such total income does not exceed ₹ 500000\". s.156(3) limits only sub-section (2), so this rebate is not limited to slab-rate tax; how it meets special-rate tax is W-089's (D-074). Not amended by FA 2026. 1961 counterpart: s.87A. TY 2025-26 version arrives with W-052c.",
